cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  The Dynamics of Speed and Accuracy: Motor Coupling and the Slopes of the
  Classical Laws. Code and data.
message: If you use this software or these data, please cite the paper.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Code and derived data behind the paper. The simulations of the minimal and
  the full model of practice, the classical laws of Hick, Hyman and Fitts and
  the impulse-variability equation as static cases of one simulated performer,
  the values transcribed from the published records, the plan, script and
  output of each analysis of four open datasets, one script and one notebook
  for each figure, and every output as run. No data were collected for this
  study, and every measured value comes from a published table or figure or
  from a released dataset.
